                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Values to convert, in the From unit — a single value or a list (e.g. the 8760 hourly dry-bulb values of an EPW). NaN passes through.</item>
                        <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">491b337e-78de-4f32-aca6-0b95a64bdc7e</item>
                        <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Values</item>
