              </items>
              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="5">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Visualize a probed vector field: colored velocity arrows, a point cloud, a heatmap mesh, streamlines, volumetric smoke, a streamline map (speed heatmap under black arrowed streamlines) or LIC (the heatmap under thin white strands gliding with the flow); pick via Display Mode. Feed the Probe component's points + velocity vectors (Field = U), or any points + vectors. For a field without direction — CO2, temperature, age of air, Cp — use the Scalar Field Viewer.

Version 1.19.0.827

Version 1.21.0.827

Version 1.21.0.827</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">9c85f7ec-7fff-46e7-bd2c-b92426261296</item>
